# AegisArchive bundle integrity manifest (SHA-256)
#
# The zero-install repository ships no binaries by design. When portable
# runtimes, engines, or models are vendored alongside this repository
# (e.g. runtime/python/, runtime/llama/), pin their digests here:
#
#   python3 cli/verify_bundle.py --generate --root runtime
#   python3 cli/verify_bundle.py --manifest CHECKSUMS.sha256 --root runtime
#
# The launcher's --verify flag runs the same check before starting the
# station and refuses to start on any failure (fail-closed).
